{
  "_comment": "Claude Code 权限基线（toolkit 初始化自动落地到目标项目 .claude/settings.json，仅当文件不存在时写入、不覆盖手维护配置）。黑名单反转模式（2026-09-14 主仓经验移植）：Bash 默认放行，危险门 ask 前置确认 / deny 硬拦（优先级 deny > ask > allow）；读取家目录放行（读取护栏 Read(~/**) 保底）。复合命令 Claude Code 自动按子命令逐个校验，前缀 :* 通配即可覆盖。",
  "permissions": {
    "allow": [
      "Bash",
      "Read(//**)",
      "Read(~/**)"
    ],
    "ask": [
      "Bash(sudo:*)",
      "Bash(rm -rf:*)",
      "Bash(rm -fr:*)",
      "Bash(git push:*)",
      "Bash(git reset --hard:*)"
    ],
    "deny": [
      "Bash(git clean:*)"
    ]
  },
  "enableAllProjectMcpServers": true,
  "disabledMcpjsonServers": [],
  "hooks": {
    "SessionStart": [
      {
        "matcher": "",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "bash .claude/hooks/ensure-skills-link.sh"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
